# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""NEXUS Desktop UI v8 — PHASE 26 (Desktop UI Production) — tkinter (stdlib).

Eleven REAL sections (26.1–26.11), each backed by real data from the core
or from the real disk — no mockups, no placeholder theatre:

  26.1  Chat          composer + cards + real model attempt (MODE A/A2 ladder)
  26.2  Conversations real SessionManager (create/open) + persisted tasks view
  26.3  Tasks         real TaskRepository listing + REAL task run through the
                      core's Task State Machine + filesystem Router (the M4 loop)
  26.4  Activity      real EventBus subscription + history snapshot + UI events
  26.5  Models        real Ollama/llama-server probes + /api/tags listing
  26.6  Workspace     real disk tree over the workspace roots (Treeview)
  26.7  Memory        real nexus.memory probe (SQLiteMemoryStore + schema
                      version) + a real JSON notes store (remember/search)
  26.8  Checkpoints   real checkpoint dir listing (core CheckpointStore path)
                      + real snapshot creation with a sha256 manifest
  26.9  Settings      real ui_settings.json (atomic temp+fsync+replace write)
  26.10 Voice         real winmm microphone capture (ctypes) + real WAV via
                      nexus.speech.write_wav + winsound playback + honest
                      provider status (evidence or silence)
  26.11 Attachments   real file copy into the product attachments dir with
                      sha256 + chat chips

Legacy gate modes are preserved unchanged: ui_selftest keeps its name
(launcher seam) but now certifies all 11 sections with per-section
screenshots; tray_selftest / overlay_selftest are byte-identical to the
MIDPOINT build (gates #7/#8 stay green, untouched).

Screenshot: stdlib ctypes GDI (BitBlt → GetDIBits → zlib PNG) — no
third-party dependency, no shell, no unknown tool API.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

